color="#993300" face=Arial><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
Arial;color:#993300;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Kevin Fleming and Dr. Thomas Blinn
hit the nail. Patch kit 3 wasn&#8217;t an improvement for /usr/lbin/lpd and the
problem is under investigation. I installed Pk2 lpd and now lpd frees again the
queue (but still fills the log file with the error messages) so that printing
to the printservers works.<o:p></o:p></span></font></p>

