Many thanks to Paul Roetman for his Oracle hint.
Using that showed that Oracle _is_ ok.

Baan finally sent some kernel parameter hints.
The three most important:
vfs fifo-do-adaptive=0 (default:1)
vm gh_fail_if_no_mem=0 (default:1)
generic: vm_swap_eager=0 (default:1)

Performance is good now.

