Firstly thank you for all of the fast responses from 
Matthias, Kris and Corinne at Compaq.

My inelegant solution to the problem was to delete the 
UNITS, re-init the containers and add the UNITS back again.
This was not a problem as we had no data on them ... Yet.

Matthias suggested that I upgrade the HBA Firmware which is 
a good Idea anyway and I will arrange to get a copy to the 
Customer ASAP.

Other sugestions included :

- Check the connections are set to Tru64 and not NT
- Confirm that the host connections are allowed access by 
the controller.
- Check zoning configuration

