------- Original message -------
We recently purchased an IntraServer ITI-6200U2 dual SCSI controller
and installed it on our AlphaServer 2100.  The console reports it but
the OS (Tru64 4.0E) does not see it.  Does anyone have any
recommendations on what to look for to fix this?  
------- End of original message -------

Simple answer - boot genvmunix and run doconfig.  D'oh.  I don't know
what I was thinking, but apparently I just wasn't.  

Several people responded.  Some folks were under the impression that
either the ITI devices were not supported under 4.0E or that license
activation was necessary.  Neither of these happen to be the case, at
least for this controller, which seems to be working fine now.

