My Original question??
Which of these two machines are best used for a server.

I got several answers. All of them pretty much said the same thing. It
depends if you want the scalabity for a server. The DS20 will take 2
CPU's and more memory. It is heavier duty and costs a bunch more.

The XP1000 is supposed to be a work station. Either will do it depends
on the work load. Cost less a bunch less than the DS20.

So it depends on its intended uses and load level and how fat the purse
is.


