Thanks to those that responded.  Every response was along the same lines,
but with a few differences.

Basic idea:
*  run dxaccounts
*  select local templates
*  select the default template
*  change the minimum password length (it's set to 0, which apparently
means, take a default value of 9 ?)
*  it's not clear whether changing the default affects all accounts, or just
new ones.  (I think it affects all accounts that currently have "default"
selected as their template.)

