Here is the summary.

DEC 3000 systems are not supported in V5.1, and won't work in V5.1A when it 
is released. V5.1A will be the first release of Tru64 UNIX and TruCluster 
software to support LAN interconnect.
On version 5.1 the only supported cluster interconnect is memory channel. On 
5.1A you will have an option to use 100MB ethernet (only 100MB) as the 
cluster interconnect. This connection MUST be a private network so your 
cluster members must have at least 2 ethernet connections.


